WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.094
This is the Prompt Bench,

2
00:00:02.094 --> 00:00:04.883
and it's where everything starts. Watch.

3
00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:07.394
If I ask Claude for a birthday card,

4
00:00:07.394 --> 00:00:09.347
I get a card. Nobody's card.

5
00:00:09.347 --> 00:00:12.485
Now I brief it like a brilliant new teammate:

6
00:00:12.485 --> 00:00:15.135
it's for my nephew, he's turning nine,

7
00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:17.506
he loves sharks and terrible puns,

8
00:00:17.506 --> 00:00:20.226
and it has to fit inside a folded card.

9
00:00:20.226 --> 00:00:21.900
Same tool, better brief.

10
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.853
And if it's not quite right,

11
00:00:23.853 --> 00:00:25.178
I don't start over.

12
00:00:25.178 --> 00:00:26.991
I just say what to change.

13
00:00:26.991 --> 00:00:29.223
Your turn. Grab the recipe card,

14
00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:31.106
then come back and tell me:

15
00:00:31.106 --> 00:00:32.640
what did Claude guess?
